; ============================================================================
;  BATHROOM  --  3.0 x 3.0 m, 2.4 m ceiling. Doorway on the +Z wall.
;
;  Hazards: wet tile floor (with a slip trigger), and no grab bar within reach
;  of the point where you actually step into the bath.
;
;  The short bar that IS fitted sits at the far end of the tub -- a very common
;  real-world installation error, and the reason the "no grab bar" hazard and
;  the handrail compliance zone can coexist here. There is something to hold;
;  it is just not where you need it.
; ============================================================================

